{
  "format": "tee-scenario",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "qm-pushrod-v6-38",
  "description": "Card P's drag run for \"3.8 L pushrod V6\": card I's launch (traction control on, the car's own clutch), staged at 8.0 s, the green at 10.5 s; its own gearbox's shifts; the revs held at the green (the brake held, the pedal floored 1.5 s before); the tyres warm, in their window (placed by content/validation/archetypes/quarter_mile.py). Read car.t1320 and car.v1320.",
